@startuml
title ProductOfferingQualification - Common

box "Wholebuyer" #E0E0E0
  participant "BuyerGW" as BuyerGW
end box
box "Wholeseller" #E0E0E0
  participant "SellerGW" as SellerGW
end box

== Wholesale Broadband - ProductOfferingQualification - Common ==

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 1 POST /WholesaleBroadband/Seller/ProductOfferingQualification
activate SellerGW
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 2 201 Created

SellerGW -> BuyerGW : 3 POST /WholesaleBroadband/Buyer/Notification/\nProductOfferingQualificationStateChangeEvent\nstate: done
BuyerGW --> SellerGW : 4 201 Created
deactivate SellerGW

@enduml
